WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.962
Check four.

2
00:00:00.962 --> 00:00:05.101
What does the plan script need before it
sends anything with the apply switch?

3
00:00:05.101 --> 00:00:06.213
Only the switch?

4
00:00:06.213 --> 00:00:10.888
The approved hash, a live collection and
a delegated session in the right tenant?

5
00:00:10.888 --> 00:00:12.412
A Global Administrator?

6
00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:13.800
Or a fixture folder?
